<title>ITALY: Italy bourse opening delayed due to tech problems.</title>
<headline>Italy bourse opening delayed due to tech problems.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The opening of the Milan stock market has been delayed to 0950 GMT from its normal starting time of 0900 GMT due to technical problems, the Bourse Council said on Friday.</p>
